Package: koladafun
Title: Funktioner för Koladata
Version: 0.1.1
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Authors@R: 
    person(
        given = "Nejdet",
        family = "Eken",
        email = "nejdet.eken@rka.nu",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Provides functions for retrieving, exploring and analyzing
    statistics from Kolada, a Swedish database of key performance
    indicators for municipalities and regions. The package uses the
    Kolada API to retrieve statistical data, indicator metadata and
    organizational unit information. Users can filter data by municipality,
    region, year and gender, identify the latest available observations,
    calculate changes over time and compare municipalities using
    predefined comparison groups. Functions are available with both
    Swedish and English names.
